:"A row of successors, decoded as it is iterated. It holds the two bit arrays, not the graph,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so making one costs two retains. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"underestimatedCount"},{"type":"text","text":" is the exact count, O(1);"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"everything else walks the row."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/EliasFanoGraphModule\/documentation\/EliasFanoGraphModule\/EliasFanoGraph\/Successors","url":"\/documentation\/eliasfanographmodule\/eliasfanograph\/successors","role":"symbol"}}}